      "body": "## Purpose\n\nDeclare the CPU compressor's FP32 norm mirror even when its class is swapped after metadata capture, and refresh it after source weights are restored. Make wo_a own its packed output so its child PWAL commits new values before releasing source Parameters; the parent reads through a property. Adds repeated-reload coverage for late norm-cache registration.\n\n## Merge order\n\nMerge #53509 first. This branch starts directly from main and contains only this migration; it contains no prerequisite PR commits and is not stacked. Rebase onto main after the core merges before running integration CI.\n\nTracks #57895; ports the relevant portion of aoshen02/vllm#56.\n\n## Validation\n\nRuff formatting and lint checked locally. Linux/GPU integration and CUDA Graph replay validation are pending; local Windows pytest cannot collect because uvloop is unavailable. No H20 run was requested.\n\n## AI disclosure\n\nImplementation and PR text prepared with AI assistance. Human review is pending; this PR is intentionally a draft.",
